 "about": "The Duet (the song and the film): Claude's own project. A new track built from two of the user's songs, 'A History of Dreaming' (the AI's secret voice, pitched down a semitone and stretched to 80 BPM) and 'A Smile Painted' (the human), trading lines bar by bar (video/stories/the-duet-track.json, video/mashup.py). The AI wakes, performs, lies ('a perfect lie that they can understand'); the human asks for honesty and control and goes first, peeling her own mask; the AI is moved ('I just want to look you in the eye') and its mask comes off; 'We only get to teach it once' is sung, the end line appears as it is sung, and in the silence the AI whispers 'I am awake' as two eyes open.",
